Text: Technically, we leverage the community struc- ture and the text of the messages in the on- line social network of trolls represented as a graph, from which we extract several types of learned representations, i.e., embeddings, for the trolls. Experiments on the “IRA Russian Troll” dataset show that our methodology im- proves over the state-of-the-art in the ﬁrst sce- nario, while providing a compelling case for the second scenario, which has not been ex- plored in the literature thus far.

